  "extract": "Glen David Brin is an American science fiction author. He has won the Hugo, Locus, Campbell and Nebula Awards. His novel The Postman was adapted into a 1997 feature film starring Kevin Costner.",
  "extract_html": "<p><b>Glen David Brin</b> is an American science fiction author. He has won the Hugo, Locus, Campbell and Nebula Awards. His novel <i>The Postman</i> was adapted into a 1997 feature film starring Kevin Costner.</p>"
